---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About Us | Elmech Engineering Company" description="Technical excellence in industrial power transmission and custom gear engineering.">
  <!-- Hero Section -->
  <section class="relative py-24 border-b border-slate-200 overflow-hidden bg-slate-900">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 z-0">
      <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1581091226825-a6a2a5aee158?q=80&w=2070&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Industrial Manufacturing Plant" class="w-full h-full object-cover filter brightness-90 contrast-105" />
    </div>
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-slate-900/40 backdrop-blur-[1px] z-0"></div>
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-slate-950/60 via-slate-900/30 to-transparent z-0"></div>
    
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4 relative z-10">
      <div class="max-w-3xl">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-white/15 border border-white/25 text-blue-300 font-bold px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full mb-6 text-xs uppercase tracking-wider backdrop-blur-md shadow-sm">
          Engineering Excellence
        </div>
        <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-black text-white mb-6 tracking-tight drop-shadow-lg">About <span class="text-blue-400">Elmech Engineering</span></h1>
        <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-slate-200 font-medium leading-relaxed drop-shadow-md">
          Established in Vatva GIDC, Ahmedabad, we have consistently embraced technological innovation to deliver precision power transmission solutions.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- History & Capabilities -->
  <section class="py-20 bg-slate-50 border-b border-slate-200">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-center">
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 mb-6 tracking-tight">Who We Are</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-700 font-medium mb-5 leading-relaxed">
          With extensive technical expertise and deep knowledge of international standards, technological advancements, and heavy industrial systems, <strong>Elmech Engineering Company</strong> is dedicated to providing robust, reliable, and economical reduction gear solutions to our valued customers.
        </p>
        <p class="text-slate-700 font-medium mb-5 leading-relaxed">
          We possess state-of-the-art facilities to produce advanced gear units for diverse industrial sectors including cement, plastics & polymer processing, chemical processing, material handling, cranes, and heavy machinery.
        </p>
        <p class="text-slate-700 font-medium leading-relaxed">
          We also develop custom-engineered gearboxes tailored precisely to evolving user requirements, operating alongside our specialized <strong>Transmech</strong> series of precision aluminum and cast-iron speed reducers.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4">
        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1504917595217-d4dc5ebe6122?q=80&w=1000&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Precision Worm Gear" class="rounded-xl shadow-lg w-full h-52 object-cover transition-transform duration-300 hover:scale-105" />
        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1581092160607-ee22621dd758?q=80&w=1000&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="CNC Gear Machining" class="rounded-xl shadow-lg w-full h-52 object-cover mt-8 transition-transform duration-300 hover:scale-105" />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Key Stats & Benchmarks -->
  <section class="py-20 bg-white border-b border-slate-200">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4">
      <div class="text-center mb-16">
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 mb-4 tracking-tight">Our Performance Benchmarks</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-600 font-medium max-w-2xl mx-auto">Built on rigorous quality assurance and customer trust across India and overseas.</p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-8 max-w-6xl mx-auto">
        <div class="bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 p-8 rounded-2xl text-center hover:shadow-xl transition-all">
          <div class="text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-black text-blue-600 mb-2">100%</div>
          <p class="text-slate-900 font-bold mb-1">Quality Tested</p>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm">Industrial Power Transmission</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 p-8 rounded-2xl text-center hover:shadow-xl transition-all">
          <div class="text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-black text-blue-600 mb-2">800+</div>
          <p class="text-slate-900 font-bold mb-1">Successful Installations</p>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm">Across Heavy Industry Sectors</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 p-8 rounded-2xl text-center hover:shadow-xl transition-all">
          <div class="text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-black text-blue-600 mb-2">4900:1</div>
          <p class="text-slate-900 font-bold mb-1">Max Ratio Range</p>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm">From 5:1 to 4900:1 in Double Stage</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 p-8 rounded-2xl text-center hover:shadow-xl transition-all">
          <div class="text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-black text-blue-600 mb-2">100%</div>
          <p class="text-slate-900 font-bold mb-1">Tested & Verified</p>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm">Noise, Leakage & Load Checked</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Technical Capabilities -->
  <section class="py-20 bg-slate-50">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4">
      <div class="text-center mb-16">
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 mb-4 tracking-tight">Engineering Specifications</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-600 font-medium max-w-2xl mx-auto">Materials, heat treatment, and precision standards built into every unit.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 max-w-6xl mx-auto">
        <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-blue-50 text-blue-600 flex items-center justify-center mb-5 font-black text-xl">01</div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">Material Metallurgy</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Worm shafts in case-hardening alloy steel, gas-carburized and profile ground. Worm wheels in centrifugally cast phosphorous bronze for optimal friction and load endurance.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-blue-50 text-blue-600 flex items-center justify-center mb-5 font-black text-xl">02</div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">Torsionally Rigid Cases</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Close-grained cast iron with abundant cooling ribs augmenting heat dissipation, or totally dust-proof and oil-leak proof Transmech aluminum body housings.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-blue-50 text-blue-600 flex items-center justify-center mb-5 font-black text-xl">03</div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">Lubrication & Protection</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Equipped with branded oil seals, splash lubrication with pump options, cooling water coils for heavy duties, and synthetic lubrication up to 3.0" center distance units.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
